{"seq":2,"slug":"reliability-slo","title":"可靠性、SLO 与错误预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/incident-management-oncall/foundations/reliability-slo","wordCount":1394,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"可靠性-slo-与错误预算\">可靠性、SLO 与错误预算</h1><p>&quot;我们的服务要 100% 可用&quot;听起来像个负责任的目标,实则是个昂贵的幻觉。每多一个九,成本可能翻倍,而用户在多数场景下根本感知不到 99.99% 和 99.999% 的差别。可靠性工程的第一个反直觉洞见是:<strong>完美可靠是错误的目标</strong>。真正该做的,是确定一个&quot;足够可靠&quot;的水平,把它量化成可测量的目标,再用剩下的不可靠额度去换取迭代速度。这就是 SLI、SLO 与错误预算这套框架要解决的问题,它也是判断&quot;什么退化值得叫醒人&quot;的客观标尺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-sli-slo-sla-与错误预算\">核心概念:SLI、SLO、SLA 与错误预算</h2><p>四个术语经常被混用,但它们处在严格的层次关系上。SLI 是测量,SLO 是你给自己定的目标,SLA 是你对客户的合同承诺(违约要赔钱),错误预算则是 SLO 留出的&quot;允许犯错&quot;的空间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[SLI 服务等级指标&lt;br/&gt;客观测量: 成功率·延迟·新鲜度] --&gt; B[SLO 服务等级目标&lt;br/&gt;内部目标: 如 99.9%]&#10;    B --&gt; C[错误预算 Error Budget&lt;br/&gt;= 100% - SLO]&#10;    B --&gt; D[SLA 服务等级协议&lt;br/&gt;对外合同, 通常松于 SLO]&#10;    C --&gt; E{预算充足?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[可大胆发布&lt;br/&gt;承担变更风险]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[冻结发布&lt;br/&gt;聚焦可靠性]\">graph TD\n    A[SLI 服务等级指标&lt;br/&gt;客观测量: 成功率·延迟·新鲜度] --&gt; B[SLO 服务等级目标&lt;br/&gt;内部目标: 如 99.9%]\n    B --&gt; C[错误预算 Error Budget&lt;br/&gt;= 100% - SLO]\n    B --&gt; D[SLA 服务等级协议&lt;br/&gt;对外合同, 通常松于 SLO]\n    C --&gt; E{预算充足?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[可大胆发布&lt;br/&gt;承担变更风险]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[冻结发布&lt;br/&gt;聚焦可靠性]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>面向</th>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>违反后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SLI</td>\n<td>工程内部</td>\n<td>客观测量值</td>\n<td>——</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SLO</td>\n<td>工程内部</td>\n<td>自定目标</td>\n<td>触发错误预算策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SLA</td>\n<td>外部客户</td>\n<td>合同承诺</td>\n<td>退款/赔偿等法律后果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误预算</td>\n<td>工程与产品</td>\n<td>可消耗额度</td>\n<td>耗尽则冻结发布</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一条铁律是:SLO 应当<strong>严于</strong> SLA。如果你对客户承诺 99.9%(SLA),那内部 SLO 应设在 99.95%,留出缓冲——等你违反内部 SLO 时,离违约还有距离,有时间补救。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sli-怎么选-好的指标贴近用户体验\">SLI 怎么选:好的指标贴近用户体验</h2><p>并非所有指标都配做 SLI。CPU 使用率、内存占用是系统的内部状态,用户根本不在乎;用户在乎的是请求成不成功、快不快、数据新不新。Google SRE 的指导是:好的 SLI 应当<strong>贴近用户感知</strong>,通常落在几类——可用性(成功请求占比)、延迟(响应快于某阈值的请求占比)、吞吐量、以及数据新鲜度或正确性(见 <a href=\"https://sre.google/sre-book/service-level-objectives/\">Google SRE: SLOs</a>)。</p>\n<p>SLI 通常表达为一个比值。以成功率为例:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SLI</mtext><mtext>avail</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>成功请求数</mtext><mtext>总有效请求数</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SLI}_{\\text{avail}} = \\frac{\\text{成功请求数}}{\\text{总有效请求数}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SLI</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">avail</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总有效请求数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">成功请求数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>延迟类 SLI 不应只看平均值——平均延迟会被长尾掩盖。正确做法是用百分位阈值,例如&quot;95% 的请求在 300ms 内返回&quot;:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SLI</mtext><mtext>lat</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>count</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>latency</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>300</mn><mtext>ms</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mtext>总请求数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SLI}_{\\text{lat}} = \\frac{\\text{count}(\\text{latency} &lt; 300\\text{ms})}{\\text{总请求数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SLI</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lat</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总请求数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">count</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">latency</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>定义 SLI 时还要小心边界:哪些请求计入分母?健康检查、爬虫流量、客户端重试是否排除?这些看似琐碎的决定,直接影响 SLO 的可信度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"错误预算-把可靠性变成可花的钱\">错误预算:把可靠性变成可花的钱</h2><p>错误预算是这套框架里最有威力的发明,因为它把&quot;可靠性与速度的矛盾&quot;从一场无休止的争吵,变成了一笔可以算账的预算。定义很简单:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Error Budget</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>−</mo><mtext>SLO</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Error Budget} = 100\\% - \\text{SLO}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Error Budget</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SLO</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>举个具体例子。假设 SLO 是 99.9%,统计窗口为 4 周,期间共 300 万次请求,那么允许失败的额度是:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3,000,000</mn><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.999</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3,000</mn><mtext> 次</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3{,}000{,}000 \\times (1 - 0.999) = 3{,}000 \\text{ 次}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.999</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">次</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这 3000 次就是这 4 周的预算(见 <a href=\"https://www.nobl9.com/resources/a-complete-guide-to-error-budgets-setting-up-slos-slis-and-slas-to-maintain-reliability\">Nobl9: error budgets guide</a>)。换算成时间更直观:不同 SLO 对应的年度允许停机时间差异巨大。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SLO</th>\n<th>年度允许停机</th>\n<th>月度允许停机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>99%</td>\n<td>约 3.65 天</td>\n<td>约 7.3 小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>99.9%</td>\n<td>约 8.77 小时</td>\n<td>约 43.8 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>99.95%</td>\n<td>约 4.38 小时</td>\n<td>约 21.9 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>99.99%</td>\n<td>约 52.6 分钟</td>\n<td>约 4.38 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>预算充足时,团队可以大胆发布、承担变更风险;预算见底时,就该把精力转向加固可靠性。统计窗口通常建议用滚动窗口(如滚动 4 周),它比日历窗口更贴近用户的真实体验,也避免了&quot;月初挥霍、月底紧张&quot;的扭曲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"错误预算策略-让数字真正约束行为\">错误预算策略:让数字真正约束行为</h2><p>光有错误预算还不够,它必须配一份有牙齿的<strong>错误预算策略</strong>,事先写明&quot;预算耗尽时会发生什么&quot;,并获得工程与产品双方的书面认可。Google SRE Workbook 给出的典型策略是:若服务在过去 4 周窗口内超支了错误预算,则<strong>冻结所有非关键发布</strong>,直到服务回到 SLO 之内,期间只允许关键缺陷与安全修复(见 <a href=\"https://sre.google/workbook/error-budget-policy/\">Google SRE: Error Budget Policy</a>)。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[周期性核算错误预算] --&gt; B{预算剩余}&#10;    B --&gt;|充裕 &gt;50%| C[正常迭代&lt;br/&gt;可做风险实验]&#10;    B --&gt;|偏紧 &lt;25%| D[提高发布审慎度&lt;br/&gt;加强灰度]&#10;    B --&gt;|耗尽 &lt;=0| E[冻结功能发布&lt;br/&gt;仅修复与安全变更]&#10;    E --&gt; F[投入可靠性工作&lt;br/&gt;直到回到 SLO]&#10;    F --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n    A[周期性核算错误预算] --&gt; B{预算剩余}\n    B --&gt;|充裕 &gt;50%| C[正常迭代&lt;br/&gt;可做风险实验]\n    B --&gt;|偏紧 &lt;25%| D[提高发布审慎度&lt;br/&gt;加强灰度]\n    B --&gt;|耗尽 &lt;=0| E[冻结功能发布&lt;br/&gt;仅修复与安全变更]\n    E --&gt; F[投入可靠性工作&lt;br/&gt;直到回到 SLO]\n    F --&gt; A</pre><p>错误预算还为事故提供了一个客观的严重度参考:一次事故烧掉了多少预算,是衡量其影响的硬指标,也常被用作触发复盘的门槛。Google SRE 的常见规则是:<strong>单次事故若消耗了 4 周窗口内超过 20% 的错误预算,就必须做复盘</strong>。这把 <a href=\"../learning/blameless-postmortem\">无指责复盘</a> 的触发条件从主观判断变成了数据驱动,也和 <a href=\"what-is-incident\">什么是事故</a> 里的严重度分级形成互补——一个看影响范围,一个看预算消耗。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>完美可靠是错误目标;正确做法是定义&quot;足够可靠&quot;并量化为 SLO。</li>\n<li>SLI(测量)→ SLO(内部目标)→ SLA(对外合同),三者层层放松;SLO 必须严于 SLA 以留缓冲。</li>\n<li>好的 SLI 贴近用户体验(可用性、延迟、新鲜度),延迟用百分位而非平均值。</li>\n<li>错误预算 = 100% − SLO,把可靠性与速度的矛盾变成可算账的预算;推荐滚动窗口。</li>\n<li>错误预算策略必须事先写明、双方认可:超支即冻结发布;单次事故烧掉 &gt;20% 预算应强制复盘。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可靠性、SLO 与错误预算","id":"可靠性-slo-与错误预算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念:SLI、SLO、SLA 与错误预算","id":"核心概念-sli-slo-sla-与错误预算"},{"level":2,"text":"SLI 怎么选:好的指标贴近用户体验","id":"sli-怎么选-好的指标贴近用户体验"},{"level":2,"text":"错误预算:把可靠性变成可花的钱","id":"错误预算-把可靠性变成可花的钱"},{"level":2,"text":"错误预算策略:让数字真正约束行为","id":"错误预算策略-让数字真正约束行为"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"什么是事故:严重度与生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/incident-management-oncall/foundations/what-is-incident"},"next":{"title":"事故角色与指挥体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/incident-management-oncall/foundations/incident-roles"}}